H2700.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 10:26; 
son of: Joktan (H3355); 
brother of: Almodad (H0486), Sheleph (H8026), Jerah (H3392), Hadoram (H1913A), Uzal (H0187), Diklah (H1853), Obal (H5745), Abimael (H0039), Sheba (H7614H), Ophir (H0211), Havilah (H2341I) and Jobab (H3103) 
§ Hazarmaveth = "village of death"
the 3rd in order of the sons of Joktan

H2745.def:
A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Rois 22:14; 
father of: Tikvah (H8616); also called Hasrah at 2 Chroniques 34:22;
Also named: chas.rah (חַסְרָה "Hasrah" H2641) 
§ Harhas = "very poor"
grandfather of Shallum, the husband of Huldah, the prophetess

H2771B.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:46; 
son of: Caleb (H3612H) and Ephah (H5891H); 
brother of: Moza (H4162) and Gazez (H1495); 
half-brother of: Hur (H2354), Jesher (H3475), Shobab (H7727H), Ardon (H0715), Mareshah@1 Chroniques 2:42 (H4337), Jahdai (H3056), Sheber (H7669), Tirhanah (H8647), Shaaph (H8174H), Sheva (H7724) and Achsah (H5915H); 
father of: Gazez (H1495H)
§ Haran = "mountaineer"
a son of Caleb by his concubine Ephah

H2774.def:
A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:36; 
son of: Zophah (H6690); 
brother of: Suah (H5477), Shual (H7777B), Beri (H1275), Imrah (H3236), Bezer (H1221H), Hod (H1936), Shamma (H8037H), Shilshah (H8030), Ithran (H3506H) and Beera (H0878) 
§ Harnepher = "panting"
a son of Zophah of the tribe of Asher

H2780.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:51; 
son of: Hur (H2354); 
brother of: Uri (H0221), Shobal (H7732H), Salma (H8007H), Jezreel (H3157J), Ishma (H3457), Idbash (H3031), Hazzelelponi (H6753), Penuel (H6439H) and Ezer (H5829) 
§ Hareph = "a plucking off"
a son of Caleb and father of Bethgader
